<title>UK: HORSE RACING-SHANTOU WINS ST LEGER CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-SHANTOU WINS ST LEGER CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>DONCASTER, England 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shantou, ridden by Frankie Dettori, won the English St Leger horse racing classic on Saturday.</p>
